%E8%B5%8B_%E8%93%84%E8%83%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a2/4n1romc1v7oiasf9l6ssgudjhtdlmz5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />蓄能\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻击提高<font color=\"red\">5%</font>，若本次行动没造成伤害，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蓄能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">蓄能</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%A9%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%9C%E6%91%A7%E5%9F%8E%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/弩骑士“摧城”\"><img alt=\"头像 弩骑士“摧城”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3e/4z4o00qwyjgfm2bcwhu6yimj6qah8j6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">弩骑士“摧城”</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻击提高<font color=\"red\">8%</font>，若本次行动没造成伤害，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蓄能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">蓄能</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻击提高<font color=\"red\">12%</font>，若本次行动没造成伤害，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蓄能\" class=\"bili